OL,3,GNEWSARecord number of homeless people
OL,4,Ain temporary housing after 10% rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of people living in
OL,7,Ftemporary homeless housing in Scotland
OL,8,Fhas risen to another record high,
OL,9,Faccording to the latest figures.
OL,11,FMore than 19,000 homeless households
OL,12,Fwere being accommodated by local
OL,13,Fauthorities by March - a 10% increase
OL,14,Fon the previous year.
OL,16,FThe number of children living in
OL,17,Ftemporary accommodation also reached a
OL,18,Frecord high, rising by 5% to 10,715.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
