OL,3,GNEWSARecord number of homeless people
OL,4,Ain temporary housing after 10% rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd the number of open cases - people
OL,7,Fstuck in the system waiting to be
OL,8,Fhoused - also increased by 10% to
OL,9,Fnearly 35,000.
